# Docker / nginx

## Services

`db` (pgvector), `api`, `admin`, `nginx` (:80)

GPU API: `docker compose -f docker-compose.yml -f docker-compose.gpu.yml up -d --build api`

## Rebuild matrix

| Change | Rebuild |
|--------|---------|
| `API-Fast/src/**` | `api` |
| `Web-Manage/**` | `admin` |
| `docker/nginx/default.conf` | `nginx` |

API volumes persist `enrolled_images` / `uploaded_images` / `temp_images` only — **not** source code.

## Nginx

- Resolve API via Docker DNS `127.0.0.11` + variable `proxy_pass` (avoid stale IP 502)
- Face WS: `location ^~ /face/ws/` with Upgrade + long timeouts **before** the general `/face` regex
- Proxy prefixes: auth, members, face, timestamp, system, dashboard, images, enrolled_images, …

## Health

- API healthcheck hits `/`
- After recreate: confirm `dpu-api` healthy, then `GET /face/queue-stats`
